OL,3,GNEWSACity's central library to relocate
OL,4,Afor #6m revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeterborough Central Library is due to
OL,7,Ftemporarily relocate as part of a #6m
OL,8,Frefurbishment project expected to take
OL,9,Fup to two years.
OL,11,FThe library on Broadway will close on
OL,12,F30 October to allow books and services
OL,13,Fto be moved to Northminster House,
OL,14,Fopposite the existing site on
OL,15,FNorthminster Road.
OL,17,FThe city council said the refurbishment
OL,18,Fwas designed to meet the changing needs
OL,19,Fof the community, with dedicated spaces
OL,20,Ffor groups, events and other
OL,21,Factivities.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
